personal damage while benefiting her reaction-focused builds."},{"name":"Lumidouce Elegy","text":"CRIT Rate with an ATK passive suited to Burning-related teams; conditional outside that niche."},{"name":"Symphonist of Scents","text":"Premium CRIT DMG and ATK option with team buff utility after healing."},{"name":"Deathmatch","text":"Battle Pass CRIT Rate with an ATK bonus based on nearby enemy count."},{"name":"Prospector's Shovel","text":"Provides ATK and a Lunar Charged damage bonus under its passive conditions. A useful accessible option for her reaction damage."},{"name":"\"The Catch\"","text":"Provides Energy Recharge and increases Elemental Burst damage and CRIT Rate, helping Ineffa maintain Burst uptime and improve her Burst damage."},{"name":"Dialogues of the Desert Sages","text":"HP% event polearm that restores Energy after healing a teammate."}],"a":[{"names":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"text":"Boosts Elemental Mastery and Lunar reaction damage, making it an excellent set for maximizing Ineffa's Lunar-Charged damage and team synergy.","stats":"ATK% · ATK% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"text":"Provides Elemental Mastery and increases Elemental Energy, making it a useful alternative for supporting Ineffa's Lunar reaction damage and team performance.","stats":"ATK% · ATK% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Provides Elemental Mastery and an additional ATK or EM bonus based on team composition, boosting Ineffa's reaction damage and overall DPS.","stats":"ATK% · ATK% · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Moonfall","members":["Ineffa","Flins","Columbina","Sucrose"],"text":"Flins drives Lunar Charged damage while Columbina supports Lunar reactions. Ineffa adds Electro damage and shielding, and Sucrose groups enemies.","roles":["Support","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Storm Surge","members":["Ineffa","Neuvillette","Furina","Xilonen"],"text":"Neuvillette drives Hydro damage while Furina adds buffs and off field Hydro. Ineffa contributes Electro and shielding, while Xilonen heals and shreds resistance.","roles":["Support","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Electric Bubbles","members":["Ineffa","Clorinde","Furina","Xilonen"],"text":"Clorinde drives Electro damage, Furina enables Hydro reactions and buffs damage, Ineffa provides shielding and Electro, and Xilonen heals and shreds resistance.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Shielder","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Short Circuit","members":["Ineffa","Ifa","Aino","Ororon"],"text":"Ifa drives reactions with Aino’s Hydro and Ororon’s Electro. Ineffa adds shielding, Electro damage and Lunar Charged support.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Shielder","On-field Driver","Off-field DPS / Enabler","Off-field DPS / Battery"]}],"v":"Lunar-Charged Damage: Focus on Ineffa’s personal off-field Lunar damage and shielding.\nLunar Team Buffer: Use Silken Moon when Ineffa should carry the teamwide Lunar buff.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Sub DPS / Buffer / Shielder"],"about":"Ineffa is a versatile off-field Electro DPS and Lunar-Charged enabler who provides shielding, strong reaction damage, and valuable team support.","pros":["Strong Lunar DMG.","Strong shielding and EM buffs.","Flexible teams.","Excellent off-field damage."],"cons":["Requires Hydro teammates.","Lunar-Charged teams work best.","DMG potential depends on team synergy."],"weapons":["Fractured Halo","Staff of the Scarlet Sands","Lumidouce Elegy","Symphonist of Scents","Deathmatch","Prospector's Shovel","\"The Catch\"","Dialogues of the Desert Sages"],"arts":[{"sets":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ATK%","ATK%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["ATK: 2,000+","CRIT Rate: 60% to 70%","CRIT DMG: 150%+","Elemental Mastery: situational"],"vars":[{"title":"Lunar-Charged Damage","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Fractured Halo","Staff of the Scarlet Sands","Deathmatch"],"arts":[{"sets":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Favor ATK and CRIT; meet ER needs for your rotation.","teams":"Hydro application for Lunar-Charged.","when":"Focus on Ineffa’s personal off-field Lunar damage and shielding.","cond":"Reaction does not function without Hydro.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Lunar Team Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Fractured Halo","Deathmatch","Prospector's Shovel"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Favor enough ATK for shield strength; balance ER and CRIT.","teams":"Another character deals significant Lunar reaction damage.","when":"Use Silken Moon when Ineffa should carry the teamwide Lunar buff.","cond":"Avoid duplicating Silken Moon buffs.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Secret Source Airflow Accumulator","Teachings of Conflict","Guide to Conflict","Philosophies of Conflict","Sentry's Wooden Whistle","Warrior's Metal Whistle","Saurian-Crowned Warrior's Golden Whistle","Glowing Hornshroom","Eroded Sunfire","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Moonfall","members":["Ineffa","Flins","Columbina","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Storm Surge","members":["Ineffa","Neuvillette","Furina","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Electric Bubbles","members":["Ineffa","Clorinde","Furina","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Short Circuit","members":["Ineffa","Ifa","Aino","Ororon"]}]}}],"title":"Ineffa","el":"Electro"}